  "question": {
    "text": "<p>As shown in figure, a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>70</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math>&nbsp;garden roller is pushed with a force of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math> at an angle of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> with horizontal. The normal reaction on the roller is (Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>)</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0052_53ebbf344eee.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 187px;\" /></p>"
